        <body>
            <div xml:id="d28-a7">

                <pb facs="0516" n="506" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv10/pg506"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">(D) Copy of a Cablegram From the Secretary of War
                        to General Pershing</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-07-14">July 14, 1919</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Detail Colonel Gilchrist, necessary officers and 500 enlisted specialists for
                    service in Poland is approved. Enlisted men to be obtained under conditions
                    stated in your cable.</p>
            </div>
